Chain INPUT (policy ACCEPT)
target     prot opt source               destination
ACCEPT     all  --  anywhere             anywhere
ACCEPT     all  --  anywhere             anywhere             ctstate RELATED,ESTABLISHED
DROP       all  --  10.0.0.99            anywhere
ACCEPT     tcp  --  10.0.0.50            anywhere             tcp dpt:ssh ctstate NEW,ESTABLISHED
ACCEPT     tcp  --  192.168.1.0/24       anywhere             tcp dpt:ssh
DROP       all  --  15.15.15.51          anywhere

Chain OUTPUT (policy ACCEPT)
target     prot opt source               destination
ACCEPT     tcp  --  anywhere             10.20.30.40         tcp dpt:443
